/* Swiss numbered section label (01 — 快速入口, etc.) — decorative, aria-hidden in markup,
   sits ahead of each numbered section's heading; the English `.section-code` eyebrow that
   used to sit there for concept-b is hidden via the adjacent-sibling rule below so the two
